/** キャリアの「くらし」: 住まい（家を買う）・車・自宅の練習器具・自己投資・個人スポンサー・メディア・趣味・休暇・個人の事業・家族。 */
import { useState } from 'react'
import type { GameState } from '../../engine'
import { CAMP_COST, CAMP_PREMIUM_COST, CAREER_BIZ, LUXURIES, GEAR, HOBBIES, HOME_GEAR, SERVICES, SPONSOR_SLOT_FAME, SPONSOR_TIERS } from '../../engine/data/career'
import { EXP_KINDS, EXP_LABEL, type ExpKind } from '../../engine/models/career'
import {
  acceptSponsor,
  activeHomeGear,
  bookCamp,
  buyGear,
  buyLuxury,
  clubShareNextCost,
  hasLuxury,
  homeClubId,
  investHomeClub,
  buyHomeGear,
  canBookCamp,
  canStartHobby,
  declineSponsor,
  gearLevel,
  gearNextCost,
  hasService,
  hobbyMax,
  homeGearLevel,
  homeGearNextCost,
  homeSlots,
  housingOf,
  quitHobby,
  serviceUnlocked,
  sponsorSlots,
  sponsorsOf,
  sponsorTier,
  startHobby,
  toggleService,
} from '../../engine/career/life'
import { BIZ_BY_ID, bizEstimate, bizLifetime, bizSellValue, bizUpgradeCost, canOpenBiz, findBiz, openBiz, sellBiz, upgradeBiz } from '../../engine/career/business'
import { cycleLabel, cycleOf } from '../../engine/economy/business'
import { AppShell } from '../layout/AppShell'
import { GameTopInfo } from '../layout/GameTopInfo'
import { CarsTab, FamilyTab, HomesTab, MediaTab, Row, VacationTab } from '../career/lifeTabs'
import { useCurrentScreen, useUi } from '../../stores/uiStore'
import { useGame, useGameState } from '../../stores/gameStore'
import { formatMoney, formatMoneyShort } from '../format'
import { Icon, type IconName } from '../components/Icon'
import { badgesOf } from '../layout/menu'

type Tab = 'home' | 'car' | 'gear' | 'invest' | 'sponsor' | 'media' | 'hobby' | 'vacation' | 'biz' | 'family'

const TABS: [Tab, string, IconName][] = [
  ['home', '住まい', 'life'],
  ['car', '車', 'car'],
  ['gear', '練習器具', 'whistle'],
  ['invest', '自己投資', 'growth'],
  ['sponsor', 'スポンサー', 'trophy'],
  ['media', 'メディア', 'tv'],
  ['hobby', '趣味', 'story'],
  ['vacation', '休暇', 'plane'],
  ['biz', '事業', 'club'],
  ['family', '家族', 'person'],
]

const TIER_NAME = ['なし', ...SPONSOR_TIERS.map((t) => t.name)]

/** 自宅の練習器具 */
function GearTab({ state }: { state: GameState }) {
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const c = state.career!
  const slots = homeSlots(state)
  const active = activeHomeGear(state)
  const owned = HOME_GEAR.filter((g) => homeGearLevel(state, g.id) > 0).length
  return (
    <div className="panel scroll-y min-h-0 flex-1 space-y-1.5 p-3 text-[0.78rem]">
      <div className="flex items-baseline gap-2">
        <span className="panel-head">自宅の練習器具</span>
        <span className="ml-auto text-[0.76rem] text-ink-dim">
          置ける数 <b className="num text-ink">{owned}</b> / {slots}（{housingOf(state).name}）
        </span>
      </div>
      {slots === 0 && <div className="text-[0.78rem] text-ink-dim">寮には置けません。アパート以上に引っ越すと置けるようになります。</div>}
      {HOME_GEAR.map((g) => {
        const lv = homeGearLevel(state, g.id)
        const cost = homeGearNextCost(state, g.id)
        const working = active.includes(g.id)
        return (
          <Row key={g.id} on={working} title={<>{g.name}{lv > 0 && <span className="ml-1.5 text-[0.7rem] text-gold">Lv{lv}</span>}{lv > 0 && !working && <span className="ml-1.5 text-[0.7rem] text-bad">置けない（住まいが狭い）</span>}</>} sub={g.desc}>
            {cost !== null ? (
              <button className="btn btn-blue btn-sm shrink-0 !min-h-[2rem]" disabled={c.money < cost} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void buyHomeGear(st, g.id))}>
                {lv ? 'Lv2 に' : '置く'} {formatMoneyShort(cost)}円
              </button>
            ) : (
              <span className="shrink-0 text-[0.72rem] text-ink-mute">{lv >= g.levels.length ? '最大' : '枠がいっぱい'}</span>
            )}
          </Row>
        )
      })}
      <p className="text-[0.72rem] text-ink-mute">置いた器具は、毎週ひとりで使います（経験点・体力）。かんたん育成では、その能力も上がりやすくなります。</p>
    </div>
  )
}

/** 自己投資: 装備・サービス・オフの自主トレ合宿 */
function InvestTab({ state }: { state: GameState }) {
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const c = state.career!
  const tier = sponsorTier(state)
  const [campKind, setCampKind] = useState<ExpKind>('speed')
  return (
    <div className="flex min-h-0 flex-1 gap-3">
      <div className="panel scroll-y w-[50%] shrink-0 space-y-1.5 p-3 text-[0.78rem]">
        <div className="panel-head">装備</div>
        {GEAR.map((g) => {
          const lv = gearLevel(state, g.id)
          const cost = gearNextCost(state, g.id)
          return (
            <Row key={g.id} title={<>{g.name}{lv > 0 && <span className="ml-1.5 text-[0.7rem] text-gold">Lv{lv}</span>}</>} sub={g.desc}>
              {cost !== null ? (
                <button className="btn btn-blue btn-sm shrink-0 !min-h-[2rem]" disabled={c.money < cost} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void buyGear(st, g.id))}>
                  {formatMoneyShort(cost)}円
                </button>
              ) : (
                <span className="shrink-0 text-[0.72rem] text-gold">最大</span>
              )}
            </Row>
          )
        })}
        <div className="panel-head pt-1">オフシーズンの海外自主トレ合宿</div>
        {c.camp ? (
          <div className="rounded-lg bg-good/10 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[0.74rem]">
            申し込み済み（{EXP_LABEL[c.camp.kind]}を中心に{c.camp.premium ? '・一流のトレーナーつき' : ''}）。シーズンの終わりに行きます。
          </div>
        ) : tier >= 3 ? (
          <div className="space-y-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.04] px-2.5 py-1.5">
            <div className="text-[0.72rem] text-ink-dim">シーズンの終わりに、選んだ系統の経験点がまとめて入る（{formatMoneyShort(CAMP_COST)}円）</div>
            <div className="seg">
              {EXP_KINDS.map((k) => (
                <button key={k} aria-selected={campKind === k} onClick={() => setCampKind(k)}>
                  {EXP_LABEL[k]}
                </button>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div className="flex gap-1.5">
              <button className="btn btn-blue btn-sm flex-1" disabled={!canBookCamp(state)} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void bookCamp(st, campKind))}>
                ふつう {formatMoneyShort(CAMP_COST)}円
              </button>
              <button className="btn btn-gold btn-sm flex-1" disabled={!canBookCamp(state, true)} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void bookCamp(st, campKind, true))}>
                一流のトレーナーつき（2 倍）{formatMoneyShort(CAMP_PREMIUM_COST)}円
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        ) : (
          <div className="text-[0.76rem] text-ink-mute">世界的ブランドのスポンサーがつくと申し込めます。</div>
        )}
        <div className="panel-head pt-1">故郷のクラブに出資</div>
        {(() => {
          const id = homeClubId(state)
          const club = id !== undefined ? state.clubs[id] : undefined
          const lv = c.clubShare?.level ?? 0
          const cost = clubShareNextCost(state)
          if (!club) return <div className="text-[0.76rem] text-ink-mute">入団すると、そのクラブが故郷のクラブになります。</div>
          return (
            <Row title={<>{club.name}{lv > 0 && <span className="ml-1.5 text-[0.7rem] text-gold">出資 {lv} 段</span>}</>} sub="クラブの格 +6・練習と医療の施設 +1・知名度 +4（3 段まで）">
              {cost !== null ? (
                <button className="btn btn-gold btn-sm shrink-0 !min-h-[2rem]" disabled={c.money < cost} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void investHomeClub(st))}>
                  {formatMoneyShort(cost)}円
                </button>
              ) : (
                <span className="shrink-0 text-[0.72rem] text-gold">最大</span>
              )}
            </Row>
          )
        })()}
        <div className="panel-head pt-1">ぜいたく・社会貢献（買い切り）</div>
        {LUXURIES.map((l) => {
          const owned = hasLuxury(state, l.id)
          return (
            <Row key={l.id} on={owned} title={l.name} sub={`${l.desc}${l.weekly ? `（維持費 毎週 ${l.weekly}万円）` : ''}`}>
              {owned ? (
                <span className="shrink-0 text-[0.72rem] text-good">{l.id === 'donation' ? '寄付した' : '持っている'}</span>
              ) : (
                <button className="btn btn-blue btn-sm shrink-0 !min-h-[2rem]" disabled={c.money < l.cost} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void buyLuxury(st, l.id))}>
                  {formatMoneyShort(l.cost)}円
                </button>
              )}
            </Row>
          )
        })}
      </div>
      <div className="panel scroll-y min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-1.5 p-3 text-[0.78rem]">
        <div className="flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span className="panel-head">サービス（毎週）</span>
          <span className="ml-auto text-[0.72rem] text-ink-dim">スポンサーの格: {TIER_NAME[tier]}</span>
        </div>
        {SERVICES.map((sv) => {
          const on = hasService(state, sv.id)
          const open = serviceUnlocked(state, sv.id)
          return (
            <Row key={sv.id} on={on} title={sv.name} sub={open ? sv.desc : `${TIER_NAME[sv.minTier]}のスポンサーがつくと頼めます`} right={`毎週 ${sv.weekly}万円`}>
              <button className={`btn btn-sm shrink-0 !min-h-[2rem] ${on ? 'btn-ghost' : 'btn-blue'}`} disabled={!on && !open} onClick={() => mutate((st) => toggleService(st, sv.id))}>
                {on ? 'やめる' : '頼む'}
              </button>
            </Row>
          )
        })}
      </div>
    </div>
  )
}

/** 個人スポンサー（3 枠） */
function SponsorTab({ state, onDone }: { state: GameState; onDone?: () => void }) {
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const c = state.career!
  const p = state.players[c.playerId]
  const list = sponsorsOf(state)
  const slots = sponsorSlots(state)
  const o = c.sponsorOffer
  return (
    <div className="panel scroll-y min-h-0 flex-1 space-y-2 p-3 text-[0.78rem]">
      <div className="flex items-baseline gap-2">
        <span className="panel-head">個人スポンサー</span>
        <span className="ml-auto text-[0.76rem] text-ink-dim">
          知名度 <b className="num text-ink">{Math.floor(c.fame)}</b>・枠 {list.length} / {slots}
        </span>
      </div>
      <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
        {SPONSOR_SLOT_FAME.map((fame, i) => {
          const s = list[i]
          if (s) {
            const v = s.goal ? (s.goal.kind === 'goals' ? p.stats.goals : p.stats.apps) : 0
            return (
              <div key={i} className="rounded-lg bg-gold/10 px-2.5 py-1.5">
                <div className="text-[0.7rem] text-ink-dim">{TIER_NAME[s.tier ?? 1]}</div>
                <div className="font-bold text-gold">{s.company}</div>
                <div className="num text-[0.76rem] text-ink-dim">年 {formatMoney(s.annual)}・{s.until === state.season ? '今季まで' : '来季まで'}</div>
                {s.goal && (
                  <div className="num text-[0.72rem]">
                    目標 {s.goal.kind === 'goals' ? '得点' : '出場'} {v}/{s.goal.target}（ボーナス {formatMoneyShort(s.goal.bonus)}円）
                  </div>
                )}
              </div>
            )
          }
          return (
            <div key={i} className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-dashed border-line/50 px-2 py-3 text-center text-[0.72rem] text-ink-mute">
              {i < slots ? '空き（申し出を待つ）' : `知名度 ${fame} で開く`}
            </div>
          )
        })}
      </div>
      {o && (
        <div className="rounded-lg border border-gold/50 bg-gold/5 px-2.5 py-1.5">
          <div className="text-[0.72rem] text-ink-dim">申し出（{TIER_NAME[o.tier ?? 1]}）</div>
          <div className="font-bold">{o.company}</div>
          <div className="num text-[0.76rem]">
            年 {formatMoney(o.annual)}・{o.until === state.season ? '今季まで' : '来季まで'}
            {o.goal && `・目標 ${o.goal.kind === 'goals' ? `${o.goal.target} 得点` : `${o.goal.target} 試合出場`}でボーナス ${formatMoneyShort(o.goal.bonus)}円`}
          </div>
          <div className="mt-1 flex gap-1.5">
            <button className="btn btn-gold btn-sm flex-1" disabled={list.length >= slots} onClick={() => {
                mutate((st) => void acceptSponsor(st))
                onDone?.()
              }}
            >
              契約する
            </button>
            <button
              className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm flex-1"
              onClick={() => {
                mutate((st) => declineSponsor(st))
                onDone?.()
              }}
            >
              断る
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      )}
      <p className="text-[0.72rem] text-ink-mute">知名度 20・45・70 で枠が開き、地元企業 → 全国企業 → 世界的ブランドと、格の高い会社から申し出が届きます。格が上がると、自己投資で頼めるものが増えます。海外のクラブにいると、全国・世界の会社の額が上がります。</p>
    </div>
  )
}

/** 趣味 */
function HobbyTab({ state }: { state: GameState }) {
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const c = state.career!
  const mine = c.hobbies ?? []
  return (
    <div className="flex min-h-0 flex-1 gap-3">
      <div className="panel scroll-y w-[42%] shrink-0 space-y-1.5 p-3 text-[0.78rem]">
        <div className="flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span className="panel-head">続けている趣味</span>
          <span className="ml-auto text-[0.76rem] text-ink-dim">
            {mine.length} / {hobbyMax(state)}
          </span>
        </div>
        {mine.length === 0 && <div className="text-[0.78rem] text-ink-dim">まだありません。右から始めましょう。</div>}
        {mine.map((h) => {
          const def = HOBBIES.find((x) => x.id === h.id)!
          return (
            <div key={h.id} className="rounded-lg bg-good/10 px-2.5 py-1.5">
              <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span className="font-bold">{def.name}</span>
                <span className="num ml-auto text-[0.76rem] text-gold">腕前 {Math.floor(h.skill)}</span>
                <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm !min-h-[1.7rem] !px-2" onClick={() => mutate((st) => quitHobby(st, h.id))}>
                  やめる
                </button>
              </div>
              <div className="mt-1 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-black/40">
                <div className="h-full rounded-full bg-good" style={{ width: `${h.skill}%` }} />
              </div>
            </div>
          )
        })}
        <p className="text-[0.72rem] text-ink-mute">今週の過ごし方の「趣味の時間」で休みながら上達します（体力・調子・経験点）。腕前 30・60・90 で出来事があり、60 でコツがつく趣味もあります。</p>
      </div>
      <div className="panel scroll-y min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-1.5 p-3 text-[0.78rem]">
        <div className="panel-head">始められる趣味</div>
        {HOBBIES.filter((h) => !mine.some((x) => x.id === h.id)).map((h) => {
          const chk = canStartHobby(state, h.id)
          const gains = (Object.entries(h.exp) as [ExpKind, number][]).map(([k, v]) => `${EXP_LABEL[k]}+${v}`).join('・')
          return (
            <Row key={h.id} title={h.name} sub={`${h.desc}（趣味の時間: 体力+${h.stamina}・調子+${h.condition}・${gains}${h.fame ? '・知名度' : ''}）`}>
              <button className="btn btn-blue btn-sm shrink-0 !min-h-[2rem]" disabled={!chk.ok} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void startHobby(st, h.id))} title={chk.reason}>
                始める {formatMoneyShort(h.cost)}円
              </button>
            </Row>
          )
        })}
      </div>
    </div>
  )
}

/** 個人の事業 */
function BizTab({ state }: { state: GameState }) {
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const c = state.career!
  const total = bizLifetime(state)
  return (
    <div className="panel scroll-y min-h-0 flex-1 space-y-1.5 p-3 text-[0.78rem]">
      <div className="flex items-baseline gap-2">
        <span className="panel-head">個人の事業</span>
        <span className="ml-auto text-[0.76rem] text-ink-dim">
          景気: <b className="text-ink">{cycleLabel(cycleOf(state))}</b>・通算 <b className={`num ${total >= 0 ? 'text-good' : 'text-bad'}`}>{total >= 0 ? '+' : ''}{formatMoneyShort(total)}円</b>
        </span>
      </div>
      {CAREER_BIZ.map((def) => {
        const b = findBiz(state, def.id)
        if (b) {
          const up = bizUpgradeCost(state, def.id)
          const est = bizEstimate(state, def.id, b.level)
          return (
            <Row key={def.id} on title={<>{def.name}<span className="ml-1.5 text-[0.7rem] text-gold">Lv{b.level}</span></>} sub={`今季 ${b.season >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${b.season.toLocaleString()}万・通算 ${b.total >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${b.total.toLocaleString()}万・毎週の見込み ${est >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${est}万`}>
              {up !== null && (
                <button className="btn btn-blue btn-sm shrink-0 !min-h-[2rem]" disabled={c.money < up} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void upgradeBiz(st, def.id))}>
                  広げる {formatMoneyShort(up)}円
                </button>
              )}
              <button className="btn btn-ghost btn-sm shrink-0 !min-h-[2rem]" onClick={() => mutate((st) => void sellBiz(st, def.id))}>
                売る {formatMoneyShort(bizSellValue(b))}円
              </button>
            </Row>
          )
        }
        const chk = canOpenBiz(state, def.id)
        const est = bizEstimate(state, def.id, 1)
        return (
          <Row key={def.id} title={def.name} sub={`${def.desc}・毎週の見込み ${est >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${est}万（知名度と景気で変わる）`}>
            <button className="btn btn-blue btn-sm shrink-0 !min-h-[2rem]" disabled={!chk.ok} onClick={() => mutate((st) => void openBiz(st, def.id))}>
              始める {formatMoneyShort(BIZ_BY_ID[def.id].cost)}円
            </button>
          </Row>
        )
      })}
      <p className="text-[0.72rem] text-ink-mute">売上は知名度と景気で動き、赤字の週もあります。貯金が足りなくなると、今季いちばん悪い事業から手放します。売ると、かけたお金の 6 割が戻ります。</p>
    </div>
  )
}

export function LifeScreen() {
  const state = useGameState()
  const screen = useCurrentScreen()
  const [tab, setTab] = useState<Tab>((screen.params?.tab as Tab | undefined) ?? 'home')
  // ホームの知らせ（スポンサー・出演の依頼）から開いたときは、返事をしたらホームへ戻る
  const pop = useUi((s) => s.pop)
  const done = screen.params?.back ? pop : undefined
  return (
    <AppShell title="くらし" current="life" right={<GameTopInfo />}>
      <div className="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col gap-2 p-3">
        <div className="scroll-x shrink-0">
          <div className="seg">
            {TABS.map(([id, label, icon]) => {
              const n = badgesOf(state)[`life:${id}`] ?? 0
              return (
                <button key={id} aria-selected={tab === id} onClick={() => setTab(id)} className="relative !flex items-center gap-1">
                  <Icon name={icon} className="h-4 w-4 shrink-0" />
                  {label}
                  {n > 0 && <span className="nav-badge !-right-0.5 !-top-1">{n}</span>}
                </button>
              )
            })}
          </div>
        </div>
        {tab === 'home' && <HomesTab state={state} />}
        {tab === 'car' && <CarsTab state={state} />}
        {tab === 'media' && <MediaTab state={state} onDone={done} />}
        {tab === 'vacation' && <VacationTab state={state} />}
        {tab === 'family' && <FamilyTab state={state} />}
        {tab === 'gear' && <GearTab state={state} />}
        {tab === 'invest' && <InvestTab state={state} />}
        {tab === 'sponsor' && <SponsorTab state={state} onDone={done} />}
        {tab === 'hobby' && <HobbyTab state={state} />}
        {tab === 'biz' && <BizTab state={state} />}
      </div>
    </AppShell>
  )
}
