/** キャリアの総括（引退のあと）: ランク・通算・タイトル・代表・所属したクラブ・殿堂・家族。クラブモードへの書き出し。 */
import { useState } from 'react'
import { seasonLabel } from '../../engine'
import { CAST_BY_ID } from '../../engine/data/career'
import { careerSummary } from '../../engine/career/retire'
import { Emblem } from '../components/ClubArt'
import { PlayerFace } from '../components/PersonFace'
import { Portrait } from '../components/Portrait'
import { castPhotoId } from '../components/portraits'
import { Icon } from '../components/Icon'
import { useGame, useGameState } from '../../stores/gameStore'
import { useUi } from '../../stores/uiStore'
import { exportLegend } from '../career/legends'
import { childFuture } from '../../engine/career/children'
import { placeName } from '../../engine/career/vacation'
import { CAR_BY_ID, HOUSING_BY_ID } from '../../engine/data/career'
import { castName } from '../../engine/career/core'
import { genLabel, heirs } from '../../engine/career/saga'
import { LineageTree, NextGenSheet } from '../career/Lineage'

const GRADE_COLOR: Record<string, string> = { S: '#f5c542', A: '#f97316', B: '#a78bfa', C: '#38bdf8', D: '#3ddc84', E: '#cbd5e1', F: '#94a3b8', G: '#64748b' }
const GRADE_TEXT: Record<string, string> = { S: '伝説', A: '名選手', B: '一流', C: '主力', D: '実力者', E: 'プロ', F: '挑戦者', G: 'これから' }

export function CareerEndScreen() {
  const state = useGameState()
  const mutate = useGame((s) => s.mutate)
  const reset = useUi((s) => s.reset)
  const [done, setDone] = useState(false)
  const [nextGen, setNextGen] = useState(false)
  const c = state.career!
  const p = state.players[c.playerId]
  const sum = c.summary ?? careerSummary(state)
  // 所属したクラブ（シーズンの並び）
  const clubs: { clubId: number; from: number; to: number; apps: number; goals: number }[] = []
  for (const l of c.log) {
    const last = clubs[clubs.length - 1]
    if (last && last.clubId === l.clubId) {
      last.to = l.season
      last.apps += l.apps
      last.goals += l.goals
    } else clubs.push({ clubId: l.clubId, from: l.season, to: l.season, apps: l.apps, goals: l.goals })
  }
  // 次の主人公になれる息子（M17。物語を始めたあとは出さない）
  const heirList = c.saga?.phase === 'watch' ? [] : heirs(state)
  const close = Object.entries(c.bonds)
    .filter(([id]) => CAST_BY_ID[id] && id !== c.spouse)
    .sort((a, b) => b[1].value - a[1].value)
    .slice(0, 4)
  return (
    <div className="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
      <div className="absolute inset-0" style={{ background: 'radial-gradient(70% 90% at 20% 0%, rgba(245,197,66,0.18), transparent 70%), #07111d' }} />
      <div className="safe-px safe-pb relative flex h-full gap-3 p-3">
        <div className="panel scroll-y flex w-[34%] shrink-0 flex-col items-center p-3 text-center">
          <PlayerFace p={p} className="h-[3.6rem] w-[3.6rem] shrink-0" />
          <div className="mt-1.5 text-[1.15rem] font-black">{p.name}</div>
          <div className="text-[0.78rem] text-ink-dim">
            {c.saga ? `${genLabel(c.saga.gen)}・` : ''}
            {sum.retiredAge} 歳で引退
          </div>
          <div className="mt-1 text-[0.72rem] text-ink-dim">キャリアの評価</div>
          <div className="text-[3rem] font-black leading-none" style={{ color: GRADE_COLOR[sum.grade] }}>
            {sum.grade}
          </div>
          <div className="text-[0.85rem] font-bold" style={{ color: GRADE_COLOR[sum.grade] }}>
            {GRADE_TEXT[sum.grade]}
          </div>
          <div className="num mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] text-ink-mute">{sum.points.toLocaleString()} pt</div>
          <div className="num mt-2 grid w-full grid-cols-3 gap-1 text-center">
            {[
              ['出場', sum.apps],
              ['得点', sum.goals],
              ['アシスト', sum.assists],
              ['代表', sum.caps],
              ['代表得点', sum.intlGoals],
              ['W杯', sum.worldCups],
            ].map(([k, v]) => (
              <div key={k} className="rounded-lg bg-black/30 py-1">
                <div className="text-[0.66rem] text-ink-dim">{k}</div>
                <div className="text-[0.95rem] font-black">{v}</div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div className="mt-auto flex w-full flex-col gap-1.5 pt-2">
            {heirList.length > 0 && (
              <button className="btn btn-gold w-full" onClick={() => setNextGen(true)}>
                <Icon name="forward" className="h-5 w-5" />
                {heirList.length === 1 ? `${heirList[0].child.name}の物語へ` : '次の世代の物語へ'}
              </button>
            )}
            <button
              className="btn btn-blue w-full"
              disabled={done}
              onClick={() => {
                exportLegend(state)
                mutate((st) => void (st.career!.exported = true))
                setDone(true)
              }}
            >
              {done || c.exported ? 'クラブモードへ書き出しました' : 'クラブモードへ書き出す'}
            </button>
            <button className={`btn w-full ${heirList.length ? 'btn-ghost' : 'btn-gold'}`} onClick={() => reset({ id: 'title' })}>
              <Icon name="forward" className="h-5 w-5" />
              タイトルへ
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div className="panel scroll-y min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-2.5 p-3 text-[0.78rem]">
          <div>
            <div className="panel-head mb-1">歩んだクラブ</div>
            {clubs.map((x, i) => {
              const club = state.clubs[x.clubId]
              return (
                <div key={i} className="flex items-center gap-2 py-0.5">
                  {club && <Emblem id={`ce-${i}`} emblem={club.emblem} colors={club.colors} size="1.3rem" />}
                  <span className="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate font-bold">{club?.name ?? '―'}</span>
                  {sum.hallOfFame.includes(x.clubId) && <span className="shrink-0 rounded bg-gold/20 px-1.5 text-[0.68rem] font-bold text-gold">殿堂入り</span>}
                  <span className="num shrink-0 text-[0.72rem] text-ink-dim">
                    {seasonLabel(state.startYear, x.from)}
                    {x.to !== x.from ? `〜${seasonLabel(state.startYear, x.to)}` : ''}・{x.apps}試合 {x.goals}点
                  </span>
                </div>
              )
            })}
          </div>
          <div>
            <div className="panel-head mb-1">タイトル・表彰（{sum.titles.length}）</div>
            {sum.titles.length === 0 && <div className="text-ink-dim">なし</div>}
            <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-1">
              {sum.titles.map((t, i) => (
                <span key={i} className="rounded bg-gold/15 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.72rem] font-bold text-gold">
                  ★ {t}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div className="panel-head mb-1">家族と、出会った人たち</div>
            <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              {c.spouse && (
                <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <Portrait id={castPhotoId(c.spouse, c.spouse)} kind="face" className="face-round h-11 w-11" />
                  <div>
                    <div className="font-bold">{castName(state, c.spouse)}</div>
                    <div className="text-[0.7rem] text-ink-dim">妻{(c.children ?? []).length ? `・子ども ${(c.children ?? []).map((k) => k.name).join('、')}` : ''}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              )}
              {close.map(([id]) => (
                <div key={id} className="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <Portrait id={id} kind="face" className="face-round h-9 w-9" />
                  <span className="text-[0.76rem]">{castName(state, id)}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
            {(c.children ?? []).map((k) => (
              <div key={k.name} className="mt-1 text-[0.78rem] text-ink-dim">
                {childFuture(state, k)}
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          {(c.lineage ?? []).length > 0 && (
            <div>
              <div className="panel-head mb-1">一族の記録</div>
              <LineageTree state={state} />
            </div>
          )}
          {((c.memories ?? []).length > 0 || (c.ownedHomes ?? []).length > 0 || (c.cars ?? []).length > 0 || (c.media ?? []).length > 0) && (
            <div>
              <div className="panel-head mb-1">くらし</div>
              <div className="space-y-0.5 text-[0.78rem] text-ink-dim">
                {(c.ownedHomes ?? []).length > 0 && <div>家: {(c.ownedHomes ?? []).map((id) => HOUSING_BY_ID[id].name).join('・')}</div>}
                {(c.cars ?? []).length > 0 && <div>車: {(c.cars ?? []).map((x) => CAR_BY_ID[x.id].name).join('・')}</div>}
                {(c.media ?? []).length > 0 && <div>テレビ・雑誌・CM: {(c.media ?? []).length} 件</div>}
                {(c.memories ?? []).length > 0 && <div>思い出の旅: {(c.memories ?? []).map((m) => placeName(m.dest, m.home)).join('・')}</div>}
              </div>
            </div>
          )}
        </div>
      </div>
      {nextGen && <NextGenSheet state={state} onClose={() => setNextGen(false)} />}
    </div>
  )
}
